  "reasoning": "The defendant first attempted to cause a gas explosion by opening a gas stove and trying to create a spark with a phone. This demonstrates an intent to set fire/explosion, which corresponds to the crime of arson (放火), even though the explosion was averted, it is treated as an attempted arson. The next day the defendant used a knife to stab 20 people, causing serious, light and minor injuries, which fits the crime of intentional injury (故意伤害). Therefore the appropriate charges are arson and intentional injury.",
